    "body": "Consider the linear system\n\\[\n\\begin{align*}\n  x-z &= \\,1 \\\\ \n  x+y+(h-1)z &= 3 \\\\ \n  2y+(h^2-3)z &= \\,h+1\n\\end{align*}\n\\]\n(1) Find a row echelon form for the augmented matrix of the system.\n\n(2) For which value(s) of $h$ does this system have an infinite number of solutions?\n\n(3) For which value(s) of $h$ does this system have no solution?\n\n(4) For which value(s) of $h$ does this system have a unique solution?\n\n",
